> A hand-checkable calculation

Pooling byte frames1,4 and3,2 gives3,4. A nonempty mismatched previous screen is rejected. This local build exercises the original synthetic moving/flickering sprite, with emulator execution explicitly skipped.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/ale_envs_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
