> Interpretation and provenance

The displayed checks belong to the original local native protocol. Optional runtime skips, deferred quality checks and machine timings remain explicit. Canonical components contain reusable physical/frame adapters and pure graphs/return algebra; the report owns the experiment and its optimizer state.
